OL,3,AReform UK proposes tax rebates for
OL,4,Afirms to boost apprenticeships
OL,5,
OL,6,FYoung apprentices should have part of
OL,7,Ftheir wages paid by taxpayers,
OL,8,Faccording to Reform UK plans, external
OL,9,Faimed at delivering a "skills
OL,10,Frevolution".
OL,12,FThe party's education spokeswoman
OL,13,FSuella Braverman said a Reform
OL,14,Fgovernment would introduce an
OL,15,F"apprenticeship wage credit" offering
OL,16,Fsmall and medium-sized businesses a 30%
OL,17,Frebate on the wages of apprentices they
OL,18,Ftake on aged 16 to 18.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
